<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-douady-magnetic-drop-phyllotaxis-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Douady & Couder (1992, 1996) self-organized magnetic-drop phyllotaxis & imperfect pitchfork cascade — Model fidelity to source: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Faithfully implements Douady & Couder's (1992) Eqs. (1)-(3) and (1996) Part I Sec. 2-3 iterative dipole minimization phi_n = argmin_phi sum_{k>=1} d_k(phi, phi_{n-k})^{-gamma} with sub-grid bounded Brent refinement under both linear dish advection r_k = R_0*(1+k*G) and exponential meristem advection r_k = R_0*exp(k*G) (L140-226), alongside the exact static Hessian fold and dynamical pitchfork bifurcation equations (L232-287) and regular-spiral zero-force equilibrium solver F(G, dphi) = 0 (L289-371), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems (0 sorrys) in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_031_magnetic_drop_phyllotaxis.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-douady-magnetic-drop-phyllotaxis-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-douady-magnetic-drop-phyllotaxis-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-douady-magnetic-drop-phyllotaxis-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-douady-magnetic-drop-phyllotaxis-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Douady & Couder (1992, 1996) self-organized magnetic-drop phyllotaxis & imperfect pitchfork cascade — Morphometric validation: 91/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Validates 10 quantitative morphometric endpoints in `measure_morphoeval()` (L1074-1159): Fibonacci branch Pearson r = 0.99999 (RMSE = 0.065 deg, p = 2.09e-18 across 10 benchmark G points), Lucas branch RMSE = 0.141 deg across 6 benchmark G points, Golden Angle convergence 137.3168 deg (exp) and 137.4892 deg (linear dish) vs 137.5078 deg at G = 0.06, Lucas branch divergence 101.7031 deg at G = 0.11 with Delaunay pair (4, 7), exact 2-drop pitchfork roots G_fold = 0.773484 (exp) and 2.514560 (lin), single-drop memory ablation N_mem = 1 locking at 180.0 deg, Voronoi cell area regularity CV = 0.132 vs random placement CV = 0.612 (two-sample KS p < 1e-8), and conifer cone 2D FFT parastichy pair (5, 8)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
